      "char_start": 0,
      "char_end": 31,
      "start_ms": 148,
      "end_ms": 4926,
      "duration_ms": 4778,
      "text": "咱们今天聊的这只童子鸡，它是来自安徽皖南高山区域的纯种土黄鸡。",
      "topics": [
        "identity_source"
      ],
      "boundary_prediction_ms": 4926,
      "cut_after_ms": 4850,
      "cut_refined_by_waveform": true,
      "boundary_rms": 0.0,
      "local_median_rms": 1805.4,
      "safe_score": 92,
      "safe_grade": "A",
      "safe_reason": [
        "strong_punctuation",
        "waveform_valley_near_boundary"
      ],
      "play_start_ms": 0,
      "play_end_ms": 4850
    },
    {
      "id": "S002",
      "char_start": 31,
      "char_end": 66,
      "start_ms": 4926,
      "end_ms": 9963,
      "duration_ms": 5037,
      "text": "大家拿到手的时候，可以先别急着下锅，把袋子拆开，仔细看看这个鸡的状态。",
      "topics": [
        "general"
      ],
      "boundary_prediction_ms": 9963,
      "cut_after_ms": 9903,
      "cut_refined_by_waveform": true,
      "boundary_rms": 0.1,
      "local_median_rms": 1690.7,
      "safe_score": 92,
      "safe_grade": "A",
      "safe_reason": [
        "strong_punctuation",
        "waveform_valley_near_boundary"
      ],
      "play_start_ms": 4850,
      "play_end_ms": 9903
    },
    {
      "id": "S003",
      "char_start": 66,
      "char_end": 105,
      "start_ms": 9963,
      "end_ms": 16037,
      "duration_ms": 6074,
      "text": "你会发现它的皮是比较薄的，皮下基本以精瘦肉为主，肉质呈现出一种相对紧实的感觉。",
      "topics": [
        "appearance_meat"
      ],
      "boundary_prediction_ms": 16037,
      "cut_after_ms": 15841,
      "cut_refined_by_waveform": true,
      "boundary_rms": 0.2,
      "local_median_rms": 1972.0,
      "safe_score": 80,
      "safe_grade": "A",
      "safe_reason": [
        "strong_punctuation",
        "waveform_valley_near_boundary",
        "next_context_dependent"
      ],
      "play_start_ms": 9903,
      "play_end_ms": 15841
    },
    {
      "id": "S004",
      "char_start": 105,
      "char_end": 127,
      "start_ms": 16037,
      "end_ms": 19259,
      "duration_ms": 3222,
      "text": "这种状态其实跟它在山上的生长过程是分不开的。",
      "topics": [
        "general"
      ],
      "boundary_prediction_ms": 19259,
      "cut_after_ms": 19063,
      "cut_refined_by_waveform": true,
      "boundary_rms": 0.1,
      "local_median_rms": 1041.0,
      "safe_score": 92,
      "safe_grade": "A",
      "safe_reason": [
        "strong_punctuation",
        "waveform_valley_near_boundary"
      ],
      "play_start_ms": 15841,
      "play_end_ms": 19063
    },
    {
      "id": "S005",
      "char_start": 127,
      "char_end": 181,
      "start_ms": 19259,
      "end_ms": 27037,
      "duration_ms": 7778,
      "text": "它不是那种关在笼子里的圈养模式，而是属于跑山鸡、溜达鸡，在漫山遍野的高山环境里活动，平时的运动量是比较大的。",
      "topics": [
        "raising_activity"
      ],
      "boundary_prediction_ms": 27037,
      "cut_after_ms": 26969,
      "cut_refined_by_waveform": true,
      "boundary_rms": 0.0,
      "local_median_rms": 2340.7,
      "safe_score": 80,
      "safe_grade": "A",
      "safe_reason": [
        "strong_punctuation",
        "waveform_valley_near_boundary",
        "next_context_dependent"
      ],
      "play_start_ms": 19063,
      "play_end_ms": 26969
    },
    {
      "id": "S006",
      "char_start": 181,
      "char_end": 241,
      "start_ms": 27037,
      "end_ms": 36185,
      "duration_ms": 9148,
      "text": "正因为有这种放养空间，鸡在活动过程中会自己捕食一些小虫、小竹笋这些天然的东西，同时我们也会配合喂人工科学配比的安全食材。",
      "topics": [
        "raising_activity",
        "feeding"
      ],
      "boundary_prediction_ms": 36185,
      "cut_after_ms": 36093,
      "cut_refined_by_waveform": true,
      "boundary_rms": 0.0,
      "local_median_rms": 1806.8,
      "safe_score": 80,
      "safe_grade": "A",
      "safe_reason": [
        "strong_punctuation",
        "waveform_valley_near_boundary",
        "next_context_dependent"
      ],
      "play_start_ms": 26969,
      "play_end_ms": 36093
    },
    {
      "id": "S007",
      "char_start": 241,
      "char_end": 270,
      "start_ms": 36185,
      "end_ms": 40518,
      "duration_ms": 4333,
      "text": "这样做的逻辑很简单，就是让鸡吃得干净，咱们人才能吃得放心。",
      "topics": [
        "feeding"
      ],
      "boundary_prediction_ms": 40518,
      "cut_after_ms": 40386,
      "cut_refined_by_waveform": true,
      "boundary_rms": 0.0,
      "local_median_rms": 1827.8,
      "safe_score": 92,
      "safe_grade": "A",
      "safe_reason": [
        "strong_punctuation",
        "waveform_valley_near_boundary"
      ],
      "play_start_ms": 36093,
      "play_end_ms": 40386
    },
    {
      "id": "S008",
      "char_start": 270,
      "char_end": 341,
      "start_ms": 40518,
      "end_ms": 51370,
      "duration_ms": 10852,
      "text": "现在下单的都是活鸡新鲜宰杀，而且我知道很多朋友特别在意完整性，我们这边是保留鸡胗、鸡肝、鸡心的，整只去头、去鸡屁股后切块发货，也就是原切状态。",
      "topics": [
        "slaughter_offal",
        "original_cut"
      ],
      "boundary_prediction_ms": 51370,
      "cut_after_ms": 51254,
      "cut_refined_by_waveform": true,
      "boundary_rms": 0.4,
      "local_median_rms": 2858.0,
      "safe_score": 88,
      "safe_grade": "A",
