      "start_ms": 51370,
      "end_ms": 56000,
      "duration_ms": 4630,
      "text": "虽然切了块，但品质和整只的一样，像清蒸这种做法也完全没问题。",
      "topics": [
        "original_cut",
        "cooking"
      ],
      "boundary_prediction_ms": 56000,
      "cut_after_ms": 55940,
      "cut_refined_by_waveform": true,
